s="#m-ec7d0d58-3aff-4342-99f4-e816d7d8c0ff" label="ambiguous">ctor</l><l xml:id="m-288ba058-d875-4c41-a560-3168256bb7ca" facs="#m-a0755368-e708-4e90-91f5-762f3c329bd3" label="ambiguous">V. Me autem propter inno¬</l><l xml:id="m-1cfef7f3-56ea-45cf-9639-de3df74be840" facs="#m-9972965f-0d62-4f35-b90a-8f1a35ff68dd" label="lyrics-like">mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-841e4e6d-f9df-414c-9742-ea79ec8d2f39" facs="#m-b7c591ee-468c-46b0-ac1a-44155d0c0bc3" label="ambiguous">us.</l><l xml:id="m-4b8672a2-b2b7-4ea8-9518-afa220b3ac2a" facs="#m-b3eaee7f-88ea-4505-831f-84b00b02113e" label="lyrics-like">cén- ti-am suscepí¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ca025d1-c6bd-44c7-800a-8873526ed7b8" facs="#m-6d615cc0-b829-4bb8-99cd-b526bb1d26b4" label="ambiguous">sti : et confir¬</l><l xml:id="m-de7d1cc3-7fcf-440d-89cd-49d80b47b833" facs="#m-75f38ff8-8a0b-4404-82ec-48ddee2027c6" label="lyrics-like">má- sti me</l><l xml:id="m-7e2c5520-8ffb-4ffc-9af3-496e2a232519" facs="#m-1e4802cc-fc17-4370-a8b6-f7d7216fb32c" label="lyrics-like">*in ae-tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-947182f6-27a7-4efe-a6d0-5bea94f22271" facs="#m-a10aaf0d-2cfc-4945-bfa1-52b21e68631d" label="lyrics-like">in conspé¬</l><l xml:id="m-823e614b-7715-480e-846a-ae00c3dff47f" facs="#m-74c1dc52-9571-4f7f-91e7-5f32448bccea" label="lyrics-like">ctu tú¬ o</l><l xml:id="m-e6df8b4b-b3f2-4a80-9b75-d4c6f4abda57" facs="#m-1266caba-bee5-44ae-93ef-04855c85204f" label="ambiguous">num.</l><l xml:id="m-9513615c-e112-48bc-92f3-ab76e93a3a74" facs="#m-adad7347-4826-4587-81ca-9482d492d575" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia, allelúia. V. Beátus quem elegísti. p. 1479.</l><l xml:id="m-cfecc1df-b8cf-42e8-8b17-9ae9e663a7bf" facs="#m-340058be-b81a-4d3c-9174-2305f3af8439" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 22.c.</l><l xml:id="m-45c41ecb-41cf-48f6-b62c-6a84a8e568ef" facs="#m-5cbe04d2-1ed5-4eaa-989e-79477c512eb7" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Respóndens Jesus sadducaéis, convenérunt in unum:</l><l xml:id="m-4f2145a7-d802-4bef-9d16-b5161df53e4b" facs="#m-9c660188-906c-4fbb-9913-283e11b17f94" label="lyrics-like">Lait sadducaéis: Errátis, nescién¬</l><l xml:id="m-f00857f9-276a-4de1-90a2-7baa96220eb3" facs="#m-fcee47ed-aa1e-4502-a9e1-bf366e53a5cf" label="lyrics-like">et interrogávit eum unus ex eis</l><l xml:id="m-cc779ffb-f999-4abf-a1d0-2292667e72ff" facs="#m-794e6ee6-f7c2-4a17-b353-c7edb0958357" label="lyrics-like">tes Scriptúras, neque virtútem Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-6604f36b-d2cc-4462-91e0-e26867f09c4e" facs="#m-6836cdf8-afd8-4d19-ab17-466b34aa958d" label="ambiguous">legis doctor, tentans eum : Magister,</l><l xml:id="m-3a6b14ec-2406-4ec0-8ccd-343e1833f68d" facs="#m-c2b86e38-daf5-424b-9ef6-2795878eab22" label="lyrics-like">In resurrectióne enim neque nubent</l><l xml:id="m-508bd6d0-5627-479a-bc57-cf1255bad719" facs="#m-8454b800-8b34-4650-8f43-bcf564d18635" label="lyrics-like">quod est mandátum magnum in</l><l xml:id="m-e9c4c3c2-93f1-42d2-ab92-ab9afa873075" facs="#m-5df1cebb-11c5-4cbd-a88b-24731638c599" label="lyrics-like">neque nubéntur: sed erunt sicut</l><l xml:id="m-3f72126b-a833-4dd0-9717-01ff302f78dd" facs="#m-b79413a0-df9e-4456-9657-d02c7bd2801e" label="lyrics-like">lege? Ait illi Jesus: Diliges Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-facdcc97-172b-49a9-a1a7-8f9edb1b4003" facs="#m-9b1eec2a-b2a7-48bb-bd4d-7c9e499cf8ef" label="ambiguous">Angeli Dei in caelo. De resurre¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c187819-a544-434f-81c0-01d9354d9ca7" facs="#m-fa2bfb72-f903-4b6f-ae6d-043c456e2682" label="ambiguous">num Deum tuum ex toto corde tuo,</l><l xml:id="m-9cbd58ef-fd70-45b5-ab32-50d2165a2c1f" facs="#m-6329f1f7-9161-4918-83a5-adaf961be3d3" label="lyrics-like">et in tota ánima tua, et in tota</l><l xml:id="m-c151f52d-a61b-4ac4-bd13-e8df60879007" facs="#m-1f093649-8856-45d0-8a71-54bdd21c3bdc" label="lyrics-like">ctióne autem mortuórum non legi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ea2d8395-dd0e-4bfc-aa10-c310f10100e8" facs="#m-b3ec2be6-5b0c-456f-baad-0ea289796d88" label="lyrics-like">stis quod dictum est a Deo dicénte</l><l xml:id="m-f4094493-d2b2-405a-9eae-59ec5e07543d" facs="#m-6ec80c75-efe6-4258-a1fb-3fe9134d887c" label="lyrics-like">mente tua. Hoc est máximum et pri¬</l><l xml:id="m-51ca7665-2481-4a97-8970-fcf6e0b768cb" facs="#m-95f979eb-2015-417f-83f1-944697f99465" label="ambiguous">vobis: Ego sum Deus Abraham,</l><l xml:id="m-58ec867f-1b91-4125-992c-29583fe0a28b" facs="#m-2c45baf6-01a2-4b2b-93fc-2a6f5416c7d1" label="lyrics-like">mum mandátum. Secúndum autem</l><l xml:id="m-556a44a7-80ec-4c67-9a96-f1a54f5646ec" facs="#m-875f459c-8c7e-4389-a741-724d7d089cc9" label="ambiguous">et Deus Isaac, et Deus Jacob? Non</l><l xml:id="m-cbf60555-a9dc-4cce-858f-1348ab14667b" facs="#m-399f48ba-46a0-479a-af47-612d723439e0" label="lyrics-like">símile est huic: Diliges próximum</l><l xml:id="m-c3d2bda0-8bd9-415a-9d5e-c6fe09793e7a" facs="#m-58ab84da-46d3-4cda-b409-7cbed43ef047" label="lyrics-like">est Deus mortuórum, sed vivéntium.</l><l xml:id="m-35ce6d4d-afbe-4f8b-a00b-44ae4d5e22fd" facs="#m-6f4db9a0-1d44-4df7-b394-8a57a8f92a7f" label="lyrics-like">tuum sicut tespsum. In his duóbus</l><l xml:id="m-b7287d0b-6788-4813-9fe2-74b9c3e56698" facs="#m-50df758e-61f0-4be6-b07b-fa4061e30283" label="lyrics-like">Et audiéntes turbae, mirabántur in</l><l xml:id="m-ed83ad41-4bb3-4e87-80e0-a4e871c86ce8" facs="#m-3f7f5455-a1a1-4847-83d8-d8808cca3bc5" label="lyrics-like">mandátis univérsa lex pendet et</l><l xml:id="m-6e6fe483-fe0c-4a9d-a3b2-61a51989a3f3" facs="#m-e6ac6f76-ccb5-489f-8208-145b79c59650" label="lyrics-like">doctrina ejus. Pharisaéi autem au¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5ffa119-51b7-47b7-bc44-b9762930ccf6" facs="#m-5c1d7409-e8ae-4f19-8a41-1817bf42d8ef" label="lyrics-like">Prophétae.</l><l xml:id="m-746f639d-50a7-48cd-9b3c-5787d1b70dde" facs="#m-6f96c5d3-b5d4-4de8-be05-bec09395eacc" label="lyrics-like">diéntes, quod siléntium imposuísset</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>